    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/e305cf9a15f19635493750a3558d10ca.webp?t=1705046040\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/2a654223dfca8b99c624e5d355cd7fdf.poster.avif?t=1705046040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/2a654223dfca8b99c624e5d355cd7fdf.webm?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/2a654223dfca8b99c624e5d355cd7fdf.mp4?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Assemble your decks against various unique beasts and enemies. Each of them has its own capabilities, learn the nature and their moves and prepare your techniques to fit them<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/511df581fa294cf9696db8210d782be3.webp?t=1705046040\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/4cd0de60733102c736c6c31da292c79c.poster.avif?t=1705046040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/4cd0de60733102c736c6c31da292c79c.webm?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/4cd0de60733102c736c6c31da292c79c.mp4?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You will play as Naratha, the beast slayer who traverses along the land to find something he needs to know. In his journey, he will discover a lot of mysteries of this world, and maybe\u2026it has to have someone to do something about it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/756248060080d7b6ffc694c821ea6c0f.webp?t=1705046040\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/76fa8a69d151e365b0d8c00e5f1100b8.poster.avif?t=1705046040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/76fa8a69d151e365b0d8c00e5f1100b8.webm?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/76fa8a69d151e365b0d8c00e5f1100b8.mp4?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It\u2019s dangerous to go alone\u2026. Take some friends to go with you! Talee and a little white tiger cub are following Naratha, they can help in a fight too!<br>And you may find some more trustworthy companions to help you out on your adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/dc78dff835cb9951748199d27fedc719.webp?t=1705046040\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/ca403a321819ec9e578d583615d89a7f.poster.avif?t=1705046040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/ca403a321819ec9e578d583615d89a7f.webm?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/ca403a321819ec9e578d583615d89a7f.mp4?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There are over hundreds of cards and myriad pieces of equipment waiting for you to come and master them! You can customize Naratha\u2019s fighting deck to your liking, matching your style with bonus skills from pieces of equipment, and maybe companion cards can be the core mechanic of your deck!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/b2c88ff4661541be4fb3de38e92c418f.webp?t=1705046040\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/745e084609f3e90691e3423ce37e1e38.poster.avif?t=1705046040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/745e084609f3e90691e3423ce37e1e38.webm?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442510/extras/745e084609f3e90691e3423ce37e1e38.mp4?t=1705046040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The beasts of this world are enormous and powerful. Some tribes and cultures thrive from living together with those beasts in their habitat, some are hunting them, some are benefitting mutually, and some are just trying to survive from them. And the balance has been made. Until the darkness has plagued the land.",
